{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>ואנה</b> — a way of humility, for there is no wisdom in me that I could know this secret, except that the secret was revealed to me for your honor's sake, that you may know the interpretation of your dream and the thoughts of your heart, which you thought at the beginning of the night, that you may know them." "<b>ומלת יהודעון</b> — it refers back to the servants of the honorable HaShem."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:19:16.022262088Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}